搭推荐。\n模特/生活化场景 (Lifestyle)： 建立联想。产品在真实高标场景中的使用瞬间。\n细节深度展示 (Detail Macro)： 品质背书。特写缝隙、logo、按键、涂层等关键细节。\n底部服务说明 (Trust & Brand)： 品牌故事背景、专业保养/洗涤建议及售后承诺。", 0.6000000000000001, 1519343172, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "link": 301, "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image5", "label": "image5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image6", "label": "image6", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image6"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image7", "label": "image7", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image7"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image8", "label": "image8", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image8"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "role"}, "name": "role", "label": "role", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "role"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {}, "type": "RH_LLMAPI_Pro_Node", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [411.8990478515625, 509.8569641113281], "pos": [-3311.927490234375, 3112.260986328125], "id": 189, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RH_LLMAPI_Pro_Node"}, "order": 5}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [301, 377], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "links": [], "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "color": "#232", "shape": 1, "widgets_values": ["859693b53e80d09dede5853f0cac743d1cd5835a1eb5db562624ab506c2ae5bd.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "type": "LoadImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [394.1239318847656, 488.0879211425781], "pos": [-3795.552734375, 3109.643310546875], "id": 33, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"image": true, "upload": true}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "text", "links": [303], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "color": "#232", "shape": 1, "widgets_values": ["**1：品牌与类目深度分析**\n\n*   **类目识别：** 高端大家电 / 智能洗烘护理机（滚筒式）。\n*   **调性锁定：** 极简主义 (Minimalism)、德系精工 (German Engineering)、科技智护 (Smart Tech)、纯净专业 (Clinical Cleanliness)。\n*   **目标人群：** 一二线城市新中产、高净值人群、极简家居爱好者。\n*   **审美偏好：** 拒绝花哨，偏好留白、几何线条、高级灰白调、哑光质感。\n*   **核心痛点：** 奢品面料易损、运行噪音大、空间占用与家居风格不符、内部滋生细菌。\n\n**2：视觉风格映射**\n\n*   **背景环境：** \n    *   *主视觉/场景：* 侘寂风 (Wabi-Sabi) 或现代极简 (Modern Minimalist) 阳台/洗衣房，微水泥墙面，原木色地板，隐形嵌入式橱柜。\n    *   *细节/科技：* 纯白无垠空间 (Infinite White Studio)，水波纹玻璃，悬浮的丝绸/羊绒材质。\n*   **光影逻辑：** \n    *   *主光：* 电影级柔光 (Cinematic Soft Lighting) 与 晨间自然窗光 (Morning Window Light)，营造呼吸感。\n    *   *辅光：* 机器内部透出冷调科技蓝光 (Tech Blue Glow)，强调杀菌与科技感；边缘勾勒硬朗的高光轮廓线 (Rim Light)，凸显金属与烤漆质感。\n\n---\n\n**3：6屏详情页策划方案（统一比例：竖版 9:16，适配移动端首屏）**\n\n### 第一屏：首图海报 (Visual Impact) - 确立品牌地位\n*   **主标题：** 纯粹洗护，智感新生 (Pure Care, Smart Rebirth)\n*   **副标题：** 新一代全自动智能洗烘舱\n*   **信息布局：** 顶部居中品牌Logo，底部1/3处居中排版主副标题，留白呼吸感极强。\n*   **排版形式：** 杂志级大留白排版 (Editorial Layout)，无衬线极简字体 (如 Helvetica / 思源黑体)。\n*   **风格与素材（AI Prompt）：** \n    *   *Prompt:* A high-end white front-loading washing machine placed in the center of an infinite pure white studio, standing on a thin layer of crystal clear water with gentle ripples. Cinematic soft lighting, a subtle glowing blue light coming from inside the drum. High fashion editorial photography, 8k resolution, photorealistic, minimalist aesthetic, product photography. --ar 9:16 --v 6.0\n\n### 第二屏：卖点展示一 (The Hero USP) - 奢品级柔护\n*   **主标题：** 奢品级柔护，如沐春风 (Gentle Care for Luxury Fabrics)\n*   **副标题：** AI智能温控，真丝/羊绒专属洗烘程序，护衣不伤衣。\n*   **信息布局：** 对角线构图。左上角文字，右下角机器半透视特写，配合面料元素。\n*   **排版形式：** 动静结合，文字采用左对齐，错落有致，辅以细线图标说明“真丝”、“羊绒”模式。\n*   **风格与素材（AI Prompt）：** \n    *   *Prompt:* Macro shot of the open glass door of a white washing machine, soft glowing light inside. High-quality silk and cashmere fabrics elegantly floating out of the drum in mid-air, zero gravity effect. Soft pastel lighting, elegant and luxurious atmosphere, highly detailed textures, commercial product shot. --ar 9:16 --v 6.0\n\n### 第三屏：卖点展示二 (Tech/Innovation) - 硬核静音动力\n*   **主标题：** 澎湃动力，静谧无声 (Powerful yet Silent)\n*   **副标题：** 悬浮直驱变频电机，深夜运行亦不扰眠。\n*   **信息布局：** 机器居中，外壳呈现50%透明解构状态，露出核心电机，四周环绕声波减弱的视觉特效。\n*   **排版形式：** 科技感数据排版，带有引线指向电机，标注“直驱”、“低分贝”、“高转速”等硬核数据。\n*   **风格与素材（AI Prompt）：** \n    *   *Prompt:* X-ray transparent view of a modern white washing machine showing the internal direct drive motor. The motor is glowing with a futuristic neon blue tech light. Surrounded by abstract sound wave graphics fading into silence. Dark background for contrast, cyberpunk but clean and clinical, hyper-detailed 3D render, octane render. --ar 9:16 --v 6.0\n\n### 第四屏：细节深度展示 (Detail Macro) - 毫米级精工\n*   **主标题：** 质感，藏于微距之间 (Crafted for Perfection)\n*   **副标题：** 仿生蜂巢内筒 / 极简阻尼旋钮 / 抗菌门封圈\n*   **信息布局：** 拼图式网格布局 (Grid Layout)。三张微距特写图无缝拼接。\n*   **排版形式：** 极简标签式排版，文字紧贴细节图边缘，突出质感本身。\n*   **风格与素材（AI Prompt）：** \n    *   *Prompt:* A collage of three macro photography shots of a premium washing machine. Shot 1: The metallic honeycomb texture of the inner drum reflecting soft light. Shot 2: A minimalist silver control dial with a matte finish. Shot 3: The sleek black glass rim of the door. Extreme close-up, sharp focus, metallic and glass textures, premium commercial lighting. --ar 9:16 --v 6.0\n\n### 第五屏：模特/生活化场景 (Lifestyle) - 融入家居美学\n*   **主标题：** 隐于室，显于品 (Invisible Integration, Visible Taste)\n*   **副标题：** 超薄全嵌设计，完美百搭现代家居空间。\n*   **信息布局：** 全屏场景图，文字作为环境融合字 (Typography in Environment) 巧妙置于墙面或留白处。\n*   **排版形式：** 生活方式杂志排版，弱化商业感，强调氛围感。\n*   **风格与素材（AI Prompt）：** \n    *   *Prompt:* A modern minimalist laundry room with micro-cement walls and warm oak wood floors. The white washing machine is perfectly flush-mounted into custom seamless cabinetry. Morning sunlight streaming through a large window, casting soft shadows. A tall green indoor plant nearby. Architectural digest style, cozy, clean, high-end interior design photography. --ar 9:16 --v 6.0\n\n### 第六屏：商品信息与服务 (Pro Specs & Trust) - 决策背书\n*   **主标题：** 专业参数，一目了然 (Professional Specifications)\n*   **副标题：** 尺寸指南 / 核心参数 / 10年电机质保\n*   **信息布局：** 上半部分为机器三视图（正、侧、顶）带尺寸标注线；下半部分为参数表格与售后服务Icon。\n*   **排版形式：** 蓝图/工程图纸风格 (Blueprint style)，黑白灰配色，极度严谨、对齐的网格系统。\n*   **风格与素材（AI Prompt）：** \n    *   *Prompt:* Flat vector style technical drawing of a modern washing machine, front view and side view. Clean black lines on a pure white background, architectural blueprint aesthetic, minimalist, precise dimensions layout, UI/UX design style, e-commerce specification page design. --ar 9:16 --v 6.0"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 302, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [397.5299377441406, 191.067138671875], "pos": [-2797.48681640625, 3110.600830078125], "id": 206, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}], "color": 